<section class="tab-content vehicle-design {{#if tab.active}}active{{/if}}" data-tab="design" data-group="primary">
  <div class="design-summary">
    {{#if design.v2}}
    <p><strong>{{design.chassis}}</strong> chassis, <strong>{{design.plant}}</strong> power plant.</p>
    <p>{{grouped design.dp}} Design Points · {{grouped design.price}}¥ <span class="design-ref">(Rigger 2 p.108–146)</span></p>
    {{#if design.changed}}<p class="design-warn"><i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i> Its modifications changed since the design was saved: open the Workshop and save again to update the price.</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if design.problems.length}}<ul class="design-problems">{{#each design.problems}}<li>{{msg}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>{{/if}}
    {{else if design.v1}}
    <p>This vehicle was designed with the old Design tab. Open the Workshop to carry the design over (you check each step before saving).</p>
    {{else}}
    <p>Not designed from scratch: its stats are its own (a production vehicle, or entered by hand). The Workshop can design it from scratch;
      saving there replaces its stats, and it shows you what changes first.</p>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if design.haveTables}}
    <button type="button" data-action="openWorkshop"><i class="fas fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> Open the Workshop</button>
    {{else}}
    <p class="design-ref">The Workshop needs the <em>SR2E: Rigger 2</em> module (0.6.0 or later) for its chassis and power plants.</p>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
</section>
